# The restic image freelunch runs backups with (docs/backups.md), pinned by the digest of its
# multi-arch index (linux/amd64 and linux/arm64, among others), so a backup runs exactly what was
# checked. Tag 0.19.1 was built 2026-07-05; digest read from Docker Hub's registry API on 2026-11-13
# (the arm64 image is 16.8 MB compressed). To update: pick a newer tag at
# https://hub.docker.com/r/restic/restic/tags and put the index digest of that tag here.
RESTIC_IMAGE=restic/restic:0.19.1@sha256:136600b6ff6843d61d355f7f71f460a166429f35de6fd11b568fece3c9a4d510
